# ============================================================================
# LinkShift frontend — environment template
# Copy to .env only when you need to override a default. Vite inlines these
# values at build time; never put secrets in this file.
# ============================================================================

# Base URL for the LinkShift API.
#
# - Unset (default): same-origin "/api/v1". Production serves the SPA from
#   linkshift.in and proxies /api to the backend on the same origin, and the
#   Vite dev proxy (see server.proxy in vite.config.ts) does the same for
#   localhost — so this stays unset in both cases.
# - Set it only when the API lives on a DIFFERENT origin than the SPA, e.g.:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://go.linkshift.in/api/v1
# VITE_API_URL=
